    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ziba kūng'wilembekeja Mefi-boshesi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wegeela kūbīta a ha gatī gatī ya lūgūlū, būng'wipumūkīja Ziba, ū nang'hani wa kaya ya ng'wa Mefi-boshesi; walī wabīīma nzīla na nzobe jakwe jilī na myendya ya kwigasīja a ha migongo, hama jabbakīlījiagwa migatī magana abīlī, na keki igana ja mizabibu, na keki jingī igana ja tiini, na shisaabo sha divai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūmūja ū Ziba, “Ni sha kinehe ī shose shenīshi?” Ū Ziba ūshosha, “Ī nzobe jilī ja kūdamhīla banhū ba ng'wikūlū, ī migatī na a matwajo sha kūlya a banhū benaba, ī divai ī yene ya kūyūng'wa a banhū ūlū bageehelwa nguzu ū kwikūngū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūbūūja, “Alī halī ū ng'wizūkūlū o ng'wa so būgonzo?” Ū Ziba ūng'wīla, “Ū ng'wene wikalaga Yelusalemu, nguno aliganika gīkī, ‘Ī lelo ī numba ya Isilaeli īkūnishokeja ū būtemi ūbo walī o ng'wa gūkū.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū Ziba, “Kūfuma haha ī shose ī sha ng'wa Mefi-boshesi shabizaga shako.” Ū Ziba ūhaya, “Ni nanukūlagwe ū mu makono ga ng'wa baba būgonzo ū ntemi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shimei kūndūkagūla Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wegeela Bahulimu, munhū nebe wa lūdūgū lūmò nī kaya ya ng'wa Saulo ūbasanga. Ī lina lyakwe walī Shimei, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Gela; aho aliza gīko wandya kūdūkana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyūmponda na mawe ū Daūdi na a batūmami ba ntemi, nūūlū īkī a bashilikale a balang'hani bakwe ū ntemi baalī bantingatile ha gatī, ū kū būlyo nū kū lūmoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Shimei aho alīdūkana wahayaga, “Jaga nīyo wīnge gete bebe ibūlagi lya banhū, nū gwa kūpya ūtī nago! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wakūlīpaga kūlwa mininga ayo wagiita mu numba ya ng'wa Saulo, numba īyo wasola būsugi wayo. Ū SEEBA wang'winhaga ū būsugi ng'witūnja wako Abusalomu. Ī ngelelo yako yashikaga nguno ūl'ibūlagi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abishai ūng'wīla ū ntemi, “Ni kinehe ī mvwa īyo īchile īyī īkwikalaga yūndondomela",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yūndondomela:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, yūnzuma.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi? Nizunīlījage naje nakagūtīne ū ntwe gwakwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi ūshosha alīhaya, “Bing'we ba ng'wana Seluya, mulī na mhayo kī shi ū kūlī nene? Ī gīsī ū ng'wenūyū ūlū ūbiza akūnidūkaga gīko īkī wawīlagwa na SEEBA gīkī, ‘Ndūkage ū Daūdi,’ numho nani ūyo akūbūūja gīkī, ‘Nibūlī ūlīta gīko?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Abishai na a batūmami bakwe a bangī, “Ū ng'witūnja wane, ū wa kūfuma mu mīlī gwane gete alīkooba kūnīngīja būpanga wane. Sumvwa nū munhū wa lūganda lwa Benjamini ūyū! Nekagi gīt'ūmo alī; nekagi adūkane ūmo atogelilwe, nguno ū SEEBA wang'wīlaga kwīta gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamo ū mu gīko ū SEEBA akūbūbona ū wiboneelwa wane, anilīpe yawiza a ha ng'wanya gwa shidūki īsho nalanukūla lelo īyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe būja nalo ū lūgendo lwabo ū ng'wikūūwa īlo babītīlaga. Ū Shimei nang'hwe walīko ū kū ntambūko, ū kū ntulumenho gwa lūgūlū, akūbapondanga mawe, na kūbalulumīja malindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū ntemi na a banhū abo baalī hamò nang'hwe būshika ūko bajaga, alīyo baalī banoga kīngī nasho; ūlembeela hoi wifuula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abusalomu kūndegeleka Ahisofeeli na Hushai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo ū Abusalomu na a Baisilaeli a bose būbiza bashikaga ī Yelusalemu; nū Ahisofeeli walī hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Hushai ū nwani ng'wiye o ng'wa Daūdi ūja a halī Abusalomu ūūkashikīla kūngīsha alīhaya, “Kūlaga ūhangame baba ntemi! Hangamaga baba ntemi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abusalomu ūmūja ū Hushai, “Bebe ī yenīyī hū yene ī mbika ya koolecha būtogwa kūlī nwani ng'wiyo? Nibūlī ūtajile nang'hwe ū nwani ng'wiyo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hushai ūnshokeja, “Mm yaya baba, ū nene nakūbiza nang'hwe dūhū ū nsolwa o ng'wa SEEBA; ūyo bansolile a banhū aba, na a Baisilaeli a bose, ū ng'wenūyo hū ūyo nakūdimana nang'hwe ū nene! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nīyo a higūlya ya henaho, nani ūyo shiniigelile kūntūmamīla? Ītaniigeleelilwe kūntūmamīla ū ng'witūnja? Ū nene nakūkūtūmamīla ū bebe gīt'ūmo nantūmamīlaga dūhū ū so.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Abusalomu ūng'wīla ū Ahisofeeli, “Alitwinhage lūūlū a maganiko gako. Twīte kī ī haha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahisofeeli ūng'wīla ū Abusalomu, “Bingīlage a bake ba ng'wa so a bado, abo wabalekaga kūlwa kūlang'hana ikūlū; babize bake bako. A henaho a Baisilaeli bakwigwa gīkī ī haha ū bebe wanung'haga inyema lyabūbi ū kūlī so, ūlī kūle nang'hwe gete; a henaho a makono ga banhū abo balī hamò nang'ho gakūguzuhiwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana būkoma iheema higūlya ya numba, ū Abusalomu ūlaala na a bake ba ng'wa ise mu būtongi wa Baisilaeli bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ū mu shikū jenījo, ū būganikīji ūlū būfunyiwa na Ahisofeeli boolī gītī bofunyiagwa na munhū obūūjaga kūlī Mulungu. Ū Daūdi nū Abusalomu baalī bawitegelegije gīko ū būganikīji bo ng'wa Ahisofeeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
